<![CDATA[<div class="gE iv gt" style="padding: 20px 0px 0px; cursor: auto; font-size: 0.875rem;"><span style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small;">Happy New Year!! I hope you've had a wonderful holiday season and&nbsp;that you are excited to kick off 2020!&nbsp;</span></div><div class=""><div id=":s5" class="ii gt" style="font-size: 0.875rem; direction: ltr; margin: 8px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; position: relative;"><div id=":ud" class="a3s aXjCH " style="overflow: hidden; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: small; line-height: 1.5; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><div dir="ltr"><font color="#000000" face="arial, sans-serif"><br>I want to invite you to schedule a quick call with me over the next several weeks to catch up. I would also like to make sure we are on the same page as far as your investment plans go, both in the short term and overall for 2020. I would love to discuss the new markets that we have added over the past year and discuss&nbsp;expanding your portfolio.</font><div><font color="#000000" face="arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div><font color="#000000" face="arial, sans-serif">You can use the link below to line up a time on my calendar. Looking forward to catching&nbsp;up with&nbsp;you soon!&nbsp;</font><br><div><br></div><div><div dir="ltr"><a href="https://my.timetrade.com/book/CMYYR" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://my.timetrade.com/book/CMYYR&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1578424050300000&amp;usg=AFQjCNGVbTznIcxpnfswW81TBmqL7Bm2nQ" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204); font-size: 12.8px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 9pt; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Click Here</span></a><span style="text-align: center; font-size: 9pt; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;; color: rgb(11, 83, 148); font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: